{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/sohpm4","slideIndex":2,"text":"The routing engine proposes candidates. The Python layer adds project-specific intelligence without embedding a quantum algorithm inside OSRM. Current ranking compares the returned alternatives, so it does not prove a globally optimal path for custom costs. The existing frontend is a Leaflet application, not Angular.\n\nProject sources: README.md; QuantumRescue_Implementation_Plan.md. Repository snapshot reviewed 1 November 2026."}
