{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/78aex6","slideIndex":3,"text":"The validator runs before ranking. Congestion affects travel time, and its separate score weight defaults to zero to avoid counting delay twice. Unknown width can be rejected with require_known_width, otherwise it carries a warning and suitability penalty. Restrictions cover a limited subset of conditions. No live traffic, clearance certification or validated operational ETA is claimed.\n\nProject sources: README.md; QuantumRescue_Implementation_Plan.md. Repository snapshot reviewed 1 November 2026."}
