{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/fn0bn4","slideIndex":5,"text":"Run: .\\qiskit-env\\Scripts\\python.exe -m scripts.offline_demo. The run selected osrm-0 with estimated_time_s 20.0. Blocking directed segment 1:2 selected osrm-1 with estimated_time_s 30.0, and blocked_baseline_returned_as_fallback was false. These routes, IDs, attributes and times are synthetic. This demonstrates pipeline behavior, not Kochi travel times or a real-world benefit. Closures only filter available candidates and do not modify the OSRM graph.\n\nProject sources: scripts/offline_demo.py; examples/osrm-demo-response.json; data/road_network/demo.json; observed offline demo output. Repository snapshot reviewed 1 November 2026."}
